  "content": "<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>❗ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>免責聲明</strong></span>：此模組本質上是一個內含資源包的數據包。請在 Modrinth 上查看數據包版本，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fvanilla-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此</a>。</em></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>遇到問題或擔心模組衝突？請查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/backpacks/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>中的「⚠️ 相容性」分頁。</em></h5><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MGcd6kTf/images/3c711eae7bf4953725bd3ddb34ca12c210915ad3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🎒 背包</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>一個數據包，為你的遊戲添加原版風格的可升級、染色及自訂背包！</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"158\" height=\"56\"></em></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>^ 僅在 Fabric 或 Quilt 上遊玩時需要安裝</em></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🔗 連結</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EclipseStudiosMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"167\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252feclipse-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EclipseStudios447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/elgeroingles/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252felgeroingles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/ElGeroIngles/860767aa976892908afff9f2c4b9648f/raw/eda5e7344a38837c32e34a1c0f8a4de180d38d5c/planet_minecraft_cozy.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">❤️ 特別感謝...</span></h2><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🔧 協助與工具...</span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyHighmore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Highmore</a> 的 <a href=\"https://github.com/DefinitelyHighmore/sentinel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sentinel</a> 函式庫，用於偵測關閉的容器（可能導致背包內物品的視覺閃爍）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fmitsaori%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mitsaori</a> 的背包模型。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Evtema3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evtema3</a> 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f154777837382008833%252f157097006500806656%252f1181814993537220658\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">著色器</a>，用於隱藏第三人稱視角中的選單名稱標籤。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AmberWat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmberWat</a> 的 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmberWat/NegativeSpaceFont\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">負空間字型</a>，用於在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Evtema3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evtema3</a> 的著色器中隱藏名稱標籤。</li>\n</ul><h4><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">🌐 貢獻者...</span></h4><ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us)：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>西班牙文 (es_es)：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>巴西葡萄牙文 (pt_br)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/alexsanderfer\" rel=\"nofollow\">alexsanderfer</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/MeiaQuatru\" rel=\"nofollow\">MeiaQuatru</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>簡體中文 (zh_cn)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/calmastorm\" rel=\"nofollow\">calmastorm</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>俄文 (ru_ru)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Akrek\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akrek</a> 提供。</li>\n<li>歐洲葡萄牙文 (pt_pt)：由 <a href=\"https://github.com/AlexandreC2000\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlexandreC2000</a> 提供。</li>\n</ul><p>您可以透過翻譯成其他語言來為此專案做出貢獻！請參閱<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>瞭解詳情。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">📝 實用資訊</span></h2><p>需要關於此專案的任何資訊嗎？請查看全新的<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/backpacks/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>！</p>",
